"endColumn":34,"endLine":376,"line":375},"type":75,"typeText":"∀ {α : Type u_1} [inst : LT.{u_1} α] {x y : WithBot.{u_1} α},\n  Iff (LT.lt.{u_1} x y)\n    (Or (And (Eq.{u_1 + 1} x Bot.bot.{u_1}) (∃ b, Eq.{u_1 + 1} y ↑b))\n      (∃ a b, And (LT.lt.{u_1} a b) (And (Eq.{u_1 + 1} x ↑a) (Eq.{u_1 + 1} y ↑b))))","unsafe":false,"value":168,"source":{"code":"lemma lt_def : x < y ↔ (x = ⊥ ∧ ∃ b : α, y = b) ∨ ∃ a b : α, a < b ∧ x = a ∧ y = b :=\n  (lt_def_aux ..).trans <| by simp","start":375,"end":376},"axioms":["propext"]}